        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#0F172A">1</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  解析器不做 HTML 实体解码，要印尖括号就得写 CDATA。]]></Raw>
    </Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="0" top="37" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#334155">2</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  Text 会 trim 首尾空白，Raw 保留首尾空格与换行；未设置字段继承祖先。]]></Raw>
    </Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="0" top="74" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#0EA5E9">3</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  嵌套 Text 构成富文本，子 Span 只覆盖自己声明的样式，其余继承父级。]]></Raw>
    </Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="0" top="111" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#F59E0B">4</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  8 位颜色 #RRGGBBAA 的最后两位是透明度，#38BDF880 约为 50% 透明。]]></Raw>
    </Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="0" top="148" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#7C3AED">5</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  fontFamily 用英文逗号分隔且不逐项 trim，逗号后加空格会保留前导空格。]]></Raw>
